<title>JAPAN: Taihei Machinery - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Taihei Machinery - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.19		vs	    2.30</p>
<p> Operating    loss 84 million	 vs   loss 550 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 109 million	 vs   loss 569 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 117 million	 vs   loss 571 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 7.82 yen	  vs    loss 38.11 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Taihei Machinery Works Ltd is the largest manufacturer of veneer machines.</p>
